      "title": "bt-dht: decode BEP42 ip field with v6 address",
      "message": "bt-dht: decode BEP42 ip field with v6 address\n\nThis adds decoding of IPv6 addresses into the correct IPv6 field\ninstead of outputting it as a hex encoded string. The ip field appears\nin the wild with v6 addresses, and BEP42 in combination with BEP32 makes\nit clear that the encoding is the same IP + port encoding used for v4.\n",
